lklore + human pattern psychology.\n\nNot spiritual proof.  \nNot cosmic event.  \nNot “prime devil time.”\n\nIf you tell me which intro you saw (YouTube? movie? reel?), I’ll decode exactly whose image it was.\n\nNo mystic inflation. Just clarity."
